# Waking the Beast (otherAreas 32): the first-time offer's six spells, each one missing in turn. Six chars at La
# Theine Plateau's qm3, each knowing five of Ifrit 298, Titan 299, Leviathan 300, Garuda 301, Shiva 302 and Ramuh 303
# (header lines; main lacks Ifrit, c1 Titan, c2 Leviathan, c3 Garuda, c4 Shiva, c5 Ramuh): each talk: section 1 off
# (available without the six), no other section: STRANGE_ENERGY. The six together: the main flow's 207.
lists LaTheinePlateau/qm3/onTrigger
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,254.3 job=SMN lvl=75
char c1 zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,252.8 job=SMN lvl=75
char c2 zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,252.3 job=SMN lvl=75
char c3 zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,251.8 job=SMN lvl=75
char c4 zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,251.3 job=SMN lvl=75
char c5 zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,250.8 job=SMN lvl=75
spell 299
spell 300
spell 301
spell 302
spell 303
c1: spell 298
c1: spell 300
c1: spell 301
c1: spell 302
c1: spell 303
c2: spell 298
c2: spell 299
c2: spell 301
c2: spell 302
c2: spell 303
c3: spell 298
c3: spell 299
c3: spell 300
c3: spell 302
c3: spell 303
c4: spell 298
c4: spell 299
c4: spell 300
c4: spell 301
c4: spell 303
c5: spell 298
c5: spell 299
c5: spell 300
c5: spell 301
c5: spell 302
login
c1: login
c2: login
c3: login
c4: login
c5: login
trigger qm3                             # no Ifrit: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
c1: trigger qm3                         # no Titan: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
c2: trigger qm3                         # no Leviathan: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
c3: trigger qm3                         # no Garuda: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
c4: trigger qm3                         # no Shiva: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
c5: trigger qm3                         # no Ramuh: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
